## User

Insert an element into a sorted list, keeping it sorted.

## Type

type
```haskell
insertSorted :: Ord a => a -> [a] -> [a]
```

## Term

```haskell
insertSorted x [] = [x]
insertSorted x (y:ys) = if x <= y then x : y : ys else y : insertSorted x ys
```

## ghc

```haskell
insertSorted x ys = insert x (sort ys)
```

## ghc

```haskell
insert :: Ord a => a -> [a] -> [a]
```

## ghc

```haskell
